== Plugin Integrations ==

[Pre-Orders - Extended Stock Status for WooCommerce](https://wordpress.org/plugins/pre-orders-wc/): 
* **Free version**: Split by Product stock status feature.
* **Premium version**: Automate split order following the customer request, notification to let the customers know about the update. [Know more](https://yoohw.com/docs/woocommerce-order-splitter/settings-woocommerce-order-splitter/automation-2/2/)

[Product Bundles for WooCommerce](https://woocommerce.com/products/product-bundles/): Split by Product Bundles.

[WCFM Marketplace](https://wordpress.org/plugins/wc-multivendor-marketplace/): Split by Vendor feature.

[Table Rate Shipping Method for WooCommerce](https://wordpress.org/plugins/flexible-shipping/): Recalculate the shipping fee based on Flexible shipping.

[Shipping Packages for WooCommerce](https://wordpress.org/plugins/wc-shipping-packages/): Split the shipping package along with items.

